Third-party components
======================

This program bundles no third-party code. It opens the runtime at run time,
from the path its command line was given, and the model files come from
elsewhere too. What it reaches through that runtime:

espeak-ng and espeak-ng-data
  License: GPL-3.0-or-later
  Phonemization, statically linked inside sherpa-onnx-c-api.dll and reached
  from there. This is the reason this crate is GPL-3.0-or-later, and the
  reason it lives in packages/kokoro-host, outside the MIT package: ADE talks
  to it over a pipe and stays MIT.

sherpa-onnx
  License: Apache License 2.0
  The C API exported by sherpa-onnx-c-api.dll, opened with LoadLibraryExW
  when the process starts.

ONNX Runtime
  License: MIT
  The execution provider sherpa-onnx runs the model with, loaded by it.

Kokoro-82M weights, voices and vocabulary (model.onnx, voices.bin, tokens.txt)
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Packaged by kokoro-onnx (MIT); the weights themselves remain Apache-2.0.

The Apache License 2.0 and the MIT License texts are the upstream ones and are
not reproduced here.
